TI  - Association of sweetened carbonated beverage consumption during pregnancy and ADHD symptoms in the offspring: a study from the Norwegian Mother, Father and  Child Cohort Study (MoBa).
AU  - Kvalvik, Liv Grimstvedt
AU  - Klungsøyr, Kari
AU  - Igland, Jannicke
